<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Sector, triangle and segment area</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A circle has centre \(O\) and radius \({@r@}\) cm. The chord \(AB\) subtends an angle of \({@theta@}^\circ\) at \(O\). The segment is the region between the chord \(AB\) and the minor arc \(AB\).</p>
<div style="text-align:center;" role="img" aria-label="A circle with centre O and radius {#r#} cm. The sector OAB has an angle of {#theta#} degrees at O. The triangle OAB is shaded in one colour and the segment between the chord AB and the minor arc in another.">
[[jsxgraph width="340px" height="340px"]]
(function() {
  var b = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {boundingbox:[-1.45, 1.45, 1.45, -1.45], axis:false, keepAspectRatio:true,
      showNavigation:false, showCopyright:false, pan:{enabled:false}, zoom:{enabled:false}});
  var deg = Math.PI/180, P = {};
  b.create('circle', [[0, 0], 1], {strokeColor:'#333', strokeWidth:2, fixed:true, highlight:false});
  function pt(n, d) { var t = d*deg; P[n] = b.create('point', [Math.cos(t), Math.sin(t)], {name:n, size:2, fixed:true,
      color:'#222', showInfobox:false, label:{offset:[17*Math.cos(t) - 5, 17*Math.sin(t) - 6], fontSize:15}}); }
  P.O = b.create('point', [0, 0], {name:'O', size:2, fixed:true, color:'#222', showInfobox:false, label:{offset:[6, -14], fontSize:15}});
  pt('A', 90 + {#theta/2#});
  pt('B', 90 - {#theta/2#});
  b.create('segment', [P['O'], P['A']], {strokeColor:'#333', strokeWidth:2, dash:0, fixed:true, highlight:false});
  b.create('segment', [P['O'], P['B']], {strokeColor:'#333', strokeWidth:2, dash:0, fixed:true, highlight:false});
  b.create('segment', [P['A'], P['B']], {strokeColor:'#333', strokeWidth:2, dash:0, fixed:true, highlight:false});
  function angLabel(brd, A, V, C, t) { var ax = A.X() - V.X(), ay = A.Y() - V.Y(), cx = C.X() - V.X(), cy = C.Y() - V.Y(); var la = Math.sqrt(ax*ax + ay*ay), lc = Math.sqrt(cx*cx + cy*cy); var ux = ax/la + cx/lc, uy = ay/la + cy/lc, lu = Math.sqrt(ux*ux + uy*uy); var h = Math.acos(Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, (ax*cx + ay*cy)/(la*lc))))/2; var d = Math.min(0.72, Math.max(0.44, 0.15/Math.tan(h))); brd.create('text', [V.X() + d*ux/lu, V.Y() + d*uy/lu, t], {anchorX:'middle', anchorY:'middle', fontSize:13, fixed:true, highlight:false, cssStyle:'background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);padding:0 2px;border-radius:3px'}); }
  b.create('nonreflexangle', [P['B'], P['O'], P['A']], {radius:0.24, withLabel:false, fillColor:'#1f5fa8', fillOpacity:0.35, strokeColor:'#1f5fa8', fixed:true, highlight:false});
  angLabel(b, P['B'], P['O'], P['A'], '{#theta#}°');
  b.create('minorsector', [P.O, P.B, P.A], {fillColor:'#2e9d5b', fillOpacity:0.25, strokeColor:'#2e9d5b', fixed:true, highlight:false});
  b.create('polygon', [P.O, P.A, P.B], {fillColor:'#f2c14e', fillOpacity:0.55, borders:{strokeColor:'#333'}, vertices:{visible:false}, fixed:true, highlight:false});
  b.create('text', [-0.12, 0.94, 'segment'], {fontSize:12, fixed:true});
})();
[[/jsxgraph]]
</div>

<p><strong>(a)</strong> Find the exact area of the sector \(OAB\), in cm². Give your answer in terms of \(\pi\).</p>
<p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>

<p><strong>(b)</strong> Find the exact area of the triangle \(OAB\), in cm².</p>
<p>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>

<p><strong>(c)</strong> Hence find the exact area of the segment, in cm².</p>
<p>[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked solution</h3>

<p><strong>(a) Sector area.</strong> The sector is a fraction of the whole circle.</p>
\[ \text{sector} = \frac{{@theta@}}{360} \times \pi \times {@r@}^2 = {@ta1@} \text{ cm}^2 \]

<p><strong>(b) Triangle area.</strong> Use \(\tfrac{1}{2}ab\sin C\) with the two radii as the sides.</p>
\[ \text{triangle} = \frac{1}{2} \times {@r@} \times {@r@} \times \sin {@theta@}^\circ = \frac{1}{2} \times {@r2@} \times {@sv@} = {@ta2@} \text{ cm}^2 \]

<p><strong>(c) Segment area.</strong> The segment is the sector with the triangle removed.</p>
\[ \text{segment} = \text{sector} - \text{triangle} = {@ta1@} - \left({@ta2@}\right) = {@ta3@} \text{ cm}^2 \]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
