    <questiondescription format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>This question is based on the sector, triangle and segment area formulas in the section Arcs, Chords and Segments of the CBC Grade 11 Mathematics textbook (INNODEMS). Radius 2 is no longer used: for r = 2 the sector area and the arc length are equal, so the arc-length check could not be told apart.</p>
<p id="concept">Area of a sector, a triangle and a segment</p>]]></text>
